* Native shared-bias active-input sampler candidate; not physical or fullPHY acceptance.
* Original v32 master/slave and single8um reference retained; exact v56 gain without its reference.
* SPDX-License-Identifier: CERN-OHL-W-2.0
.subckt nssoc_cml_latch_settling_v32 dp dn qp qn cp cn avdd avss sub ref
XDP qn dp se sub npn13G2 Nx=4
XDN qp dn se sub npn13G2 Nx=4
XLP qn qp he sub npn13G2 Nx=4
XLN qp qn he sub npn13G2 Nx=4
XCS0 se cp te sub npn13G2 Nx=2
XCS1 se cp te sub npn13G2 Nx=2
XCH0 he cn te sub npn13G2 Nx=2
XCH1 he cn te sub npn13G2 Nx=2
XT0 te ref avss sub sg13_lv_nmos w=36u l=.3u ng=1
XT1 te ref avss sub sg13_lv_nmos w=36u l=.3u ng=1
XT2 te ref avss sub sg13_lv_nmos w=36u l=.3u ng=1
XT3 te ref avss sub sg13_lv_nmos w=36u l=.3u ng=1
XRP avdd qp sub rppd w=32u l=2.6u b=0 sw_et=1
XRN avdd qn sub rppd w=32u l=2.6u b=0 sw_et=1
* Weak native bleeders keep the inactive emitter nodes from floating.
XBS se avss sub rppd w=1u l=38.4u b=0 sw_et=1
XBH he avss sub rppd w=1u l=38.4u b=0 sw_et=1
.ends nssoc_cml_latch_settling_v32

* Explicit slave native bleeds: data6x, hold8x; master unchanged.
.subckt nssoc_cml_slave_settling_v32 dp dn qp qn cp cn avdd avss sub ref
XDP qn dp se sub npn13G2 Nx=4
XDN qp dn se sub npn13G2 Nx=4
XLP qn qp he sub npn13G2 Nx=4
XLN qp qn he sub npn13G2 Nx=4
XCS0 se cp te sub npn13G2 Nx=2
XCS1 se cp te sub npn13G2 Nx=2
XCH0 he cn te sub npn13G2 Nx=2
XCH1 he cn te sub npn13G2 Nx=2
XT0 te ref avss sub sg13_lv_nmos w=36u l=.3u ng=1
XT1 te ref avss sub sg13_lv_nmos w=36u l=.3u ng=1
XT2 te ref avss sub sg13_lv_nmos w=36u l=.3u ng=1
XT3 te ref avss sub sg13_lv_nmos w=36u l=.3u ng=1
XRP avdd qp sub rppd w=32u l=2.6u b=0 sw_et=1
XRN avdd qn sub rppd w=32u l=2.6u b=0 sw_et=1
* Weak native bleeders keep the inactive emitter nodes from floating.
XBS se avss sub rppd w=1u l=6.4u b=0 sw_et=1
XBH he avss sub rppd w=1u l=4.8u b=0 sw_et=1
.ends nssoc_cml_slave_settling_v32

.subckt nssoc_rx_sampler_active_input_v57 dp dn qp qn clkp clkn avdd avss sub iref
XREF iref iref avss sub sg13_lv_nmos w=8u l=.3u ng=1
* Active input replaces all four passive divider resistors.
* Gain gates share the one existing8um XREF; no duplicate bias source.
XGP ln dp gain_tail sub npn13G2 Nx=4
XGN lp dn gain_tail sub npn13G2 Nx=4
XGT0 gain_tail iref avss sub sg13_lv_nmos w=53.335u l=.3u ng=1
XGT1 gain_tail iref avss sub sg13_lv_nmos w=53.335u l=.3u ng=1
XUP avdd lp sub rppd w=8u l=1.8u b=0 sw_et=1
XUN avdd ln sub rppd w=8u l=1.8u b=0 sw_et=1
XDP lp avss sub rppd w=4u l=7.4u b=0 sw_et=1
XDN ln avss sub rppd w=4u l=7.4u b=0 sw_et=1
* Master tracks low clock; slave tracks high clock, capturing a rising edge.
XM lp ln mp mn clkn clkp avdd avss sub iref nssoc_cml_latch_settling_v32
XS mp mn qp qn clkp clkn avdd avss sub iref nssoc_cml_slave_settling_v32
.ends nssoc_rx_sampler_active_input_v57

